PROMPT
PROMPT ===== TEST E9: bulk upload with mixed good and bad rows (FORALL SAVE EXCEPTIONS)  [screenshot: bulk_upload_grades_partial_errors_output.png]
PROMPT Row 1 student 1001: already graded            -> rejected by the database (ORA-00001, bulk exception)
PROMPT Row 2 student 99999: not enrolled              -> skipped
PROMPT Row 3 student 1006: score 150                  -> skipped
PROMPT Row 4 student 1008: score 70                   -> inserted
PROMPT Expected: inserted = 1, rejected = 3
DECLARE
  v_ins PLS_INTEGER;
  v_rej PLS_INTEGER;
BEGIN
  bulk_upload_grades(101,
                     SYS.ODCINUMBERLIST(1001, 99999, 1006, 1008),
                     SYS.ODCINUMBERLIST(90,   80,    150,  70),
                     v_ins, v_rej);
  DBMS_OUTPUT.PUT_LINE('OUT parameters -> inserted: ' || v_ins || ', rejected: ' || v_rej);
END;
/

